@startuml multi_agent_squad_flow
title Weather Desk: the squad runs three OpenAI agents in a known sequence

participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "WeatherDeskIntelligenceSquad\n(BaseSquad)" as S
participant "FrontDeskAgent\n(K9OpenAIAgent)" as F
participant "WeatherAgent\n(K9OpenAIAgent)" as W
participant "current_weather\n(tool)" as T
participant "AttireAdvisorAgent\n(K9OpenAIAgent)" as A

O -> O : Zero Trust, Shield ingress
O -> S : run squad (question)

S -> F : step 1: question
F -> F : Shield on input; model call (K9 Model Router)
F --> S : what the visitor needs\n(Shield on output)

S -> W : step 2: question + step 1
W -> W : Shield on input; model call (tool-calling model)
W -> T : current_weather(zip_code)\n(Shield on the call)
T --> W : weather data\n(Shield on the result)
W --> S : the current weather\n(Shield on output)

S -> A : step 3: question + steps 1 and 2\n(a governed digest if they grow large)
A -> A : Shield on input; model call (K9 Model Router)
A --> S : final answer\n(Shield on output)

S --> O : results of every step
O -> O : Shield egress on the answer

note over S : The squad's flow sets the order.\nNo agent is offered a handoff.
@enduml
